        },
        {
          "text": " Na hao waapao kwa dhambi ya Samaria, na kusema, Kama aishivyo Mungu wako, Ee Dani, na, Kama iishivyo njia ya Beer-sheba, hao nao wataanguka, wasiinuke tena.",
